    "content": "Transamerica is a major American financial services company specializing in life insurance, retirement planning, and investment solutions. Operating as a subsidiary of the international Aegon group, they serve millions of customers by providing products such as individual life insurance, annuities, mutual funds, and employee benefits. Key details about Transamerica include: Core Services: Life insurance (term, whole, universal), retirement plans (401k), and annuities. Target Audience: Individuals seeking financial protection and retirement savings, as well as employers looking for employee benefits. Structure: Founded in 1928, it is part of Aegon, a multinational financial services group based in the Netherlands. Key Distinctions: Frequently recognized for its life insurance offerings and operates its own research institution, the Transamerica Institute. Transamerica provides comprehensive financial tools for individuals and businesses to prepare for long-term security.",
